Package: devjam-science-tools-matlab
Version: 1.1-1
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: MATLAB launchers and service menus
 Desktop launchers for MATLAB with and without Psychtoolbox and OpenGL,
 service menus to run a MATLAB script in the background or as a
 Psychtoolbox experiment, and the matching command line wrappers.
